{"name":"Enchanting","hex":"#82badf","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"enchanting","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["present participle and gerund of enchant"]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having the ability to enchant; charming, delightful."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/enchanting"}],"entries":[{"title":"Incantation","blocks":[{"text":"An incantation, spell, charm, enchantment, or bewitchery is a magical formula intended to trigger a magical effect on a person or objects. The formula can be spoken, sung, or chanted. An incantation can also be performed during ceremonial rituals or prayers. In the world of magic, wizards, witches, and fairies are common performers of incantations in culture and folklore."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Book_of_incantations_f.7v.png/330px-Book_of_incantations_f.7v.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Incantation"},{"title":"Wonder (emotion)","blocks":[{"text":"Wonder is an emotion comparable to surprise that people feel when perceiving something rare or unexpected. It has historically been seen as an important aspect of human nature, specifically being linked with curiosity and the drive behind intellectual exploration. Wonder is also often compared to the emotion of awe but awe implies fear or respect rather than joy. Science fiction can produce a \"sense of wonder\"."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/I_Wonder.jpg/330px-I_Wonder.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wonder_(emotion)"},{"title":"Enchanting (rapper)","blocks":[{"text":"Channing Nicole Larry, known professionally as Enchanting, was a German-born American rapper from Fort Worth, Texas. She was signed to Gucci Mane's record label, 1017 Records, and gained initial recognition for her 2022 single, \"Track & Field\", featuring fellow rapper Kaliii, which gained over six million YouTube views as of the time of her death. She frequently collaborated with Gucci Mane, alongside Big Scarr, Iann Dior, Foogiano, and Kaliii."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/cb/EnchantingRapper.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Enchanting_(rapper)"},{"title":"Enchanting (programming language)","blocks":[{"text":"Enchanting is a free and open-source cross-platform educational programming language designed to program Lego Mindstorms NXT robots. It is developed mainly by Southern Alberta Robotics Enthusiasts group in the province of Alberta, Canada, and runs on macOS, Windows, and experimentally on Linux devices. Since 2013, Enchanting version 0.2 has been available."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Enchanting_(programming_language)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/The_Enchanted_Garden_of_Messer_Ansaldo_by_Marie_Spartali_Stillman_%281889%29.jpg/500px-The_Enchanted_Garden_of_Messer_Ansaldo_by_Marie_Spartali_Stillman_%281889%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/The_Enchanted_Garden_of_Messer_Ansaldo_by_Marie_Spartali_Stillman_%281889%29.jpg/500px-The_Enchanted_Garden_of_Messer_Ansaldo_by_Marie_Spartali_Stillman_%281889%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Enchanted Garden of Messer Ansaldo by Marie Spartali Stillman","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AThe_Enchanted_Garden_of_Messer_Ansaldo_by_Marie_Spartali_Stillman_(1889).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0d/Abracadabra_triangle_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Abracadabra_triangle_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://uplo